<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANK BEAT AUSTRALIA IN SINGER WORLD SERIES FINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANK BEAT AUSTRALIA IN SINGER WORLD SERIES FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Australia by 50</p>
<p>runs in the Singer World Series cricket final on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 234-3 in 35 overs, Australia 184 all out</p>
<p>in 33 overs.</p>
<p>The match was reduced to 35 overs after rain delayed the</p>
<p>start.</p>
</text>
